  "instructions": [
    "Prepare iron teppan pan at 400\u00020\u001415\u001273\u001457\u0015aF.",
    "Season pitted dates with salt and set aside.",
    "Heat sesame oil in iron teppan pan over medium heat, add ginger and garlic. Cook for 3 minutes until fragrant.",
    "Add soy sauce, brown sugar, rice vinegar, chili flakes, and black pepper to iron teppan pan and stir to combine. ",
    "Add pitted dates to iron teppan pan and stir to coat in sauce. Cook for 5 minutes, until caramelized. ",
    "Stir in furikake and scallions. Cook for 1 minute until combined. ",
    "Serve immediately. ",
    "Cook sous-vide sous vide water bath at 195\u001418\u0015dF. ",
    "Set aside to cool. ",
    "Place cooked pitted dates in sous-vide water bath to warm. ",
    "Serve pitted dates in iron teppan pan. ",
    "Garnish with additional furikake and scallions, if desired."
